@{
    ViewBag.Title = "How To Order: Zion Market Research";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_LayoutInternal.cshtml";
    ViewBag.MetaDescription = "How to Order:  Zion Market Research";
    ViewBag.MetaKeywords = "How to Order,Zion Market Research";
}
<section id="report-title" class="white_section section_gap">
    @{ Html.RenderPartial("_NewSearch"); }
    <div class="container">
        @{ Html.RenderPartial("_breadcrumb", "How To Order"); }
        <div class="heading">
            <div class="col-sm-12">
                <h1>How To Order</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="col-md-8 tab">
            <div class="tab-content" style="text-align:justify;">
                <p>
                    Zion Market Research provides you with below methods in order to place your respective order:
                    <ul>
                        <li>Telephone</li>
                        <li>Email</li>
                    </ul>
                    If in case you are placing an order on the company’s behalf, it is mandatory for the client to take approval in order to perform the acquisition call.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">1. Placing Order By Telephone</strong><br />
                    Our customer service representative is always available in your service to accept your order on <br /><strong>USA/Canada toll free number</strong> <strong class="underline">+1-855-465-4651</strong> <br /> <strong>International</strong> clients can dial <strong class="underline">+49 322 210 92714</strong> OR <strong class="underline">+1-386-310-3803</strong>.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">2. Placing Order by E-mail</strong><br />
                    Feel free to send your requirements and queries to <strong>sales@zionmarketresearch.com</strong>. It is mandatory that you provide all the necessary details along with request and delivery address and the preferred mode of payment. Our executives surely will get in touch with you in less than 24 hours.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Available Modes of Payment</strong><br />
                    Taking into consideration customer’s convenience, we provide below different payment methods:
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Credit Card:</strong><br />
                    It is the quickest payment method provided by Zion Market Research which also ensures the fastest dispatch of your order. We accept VISA, Mastercard, Maestro, Diners Club, and American Express. A receipt will be issued via email once your payment has been processed.
                </p>
                <p><strong class="underline">Wire Transfer:</strong><br />Once the order is been placed, either online, via fax or via post, an official invoice will be emailed to you if you prefer to do the payment via wire transfer or by company cheque.</p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Company Cheque:</strong><br />
                    As described in the above method, if preferred method by is payment via cheque, you need to send the cheque on below address along with the reference to your Order Number, which will be emailed to you at the time the order is placed:
                    <br />
                    <strong>
                        Accounts Department,<br />
                        Zion Market Research,<br />
                        705, B-Wing, Mitha Nagar Society Ltd.,<br />
                        Mitha Nagar, Goregaon (W), Mumbai- 400104, India
                    </strong>
                </p>
                <p><strong class="underline">PayPal:</strong><br /> You also have one of the options as PayPal for your payment method during the checkout process.</p>

                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">High Security Maintained During Online Ordering Process</strong><br />
                    Zion Market Research is highly concerned about the safety and security regarding any online transactions. Hence, it is sometimes necessary for us to request certain information from you on receiving an order. This information is requested in order to confirm the cardholder authenticity. We use this information to authenticate whether the person who has placed the order is the cardholder himself. You will be asked to enter your business/professional email when placing your order, as well as full invoice details in order to ensure that we can process your order as quickly and efficiently as possible.
                    Zion Market Research takes the responsibility to protect information about your credit card. When an order is placed on our, site all of the information provided by you is encrypted using SSL 128 Bit Encryption. This technology safeguards the provided personal information and guarantees high-level privacy. As an additional security step, our online payment transactions use the CVV number (the last three digits on the signature strip of your credit or debit card) to guard against card fraud. We may, on occasion, call or email the cardholder in order to confirm the transaction prior to the dispatch. We would appreciate if a company email id, if possible, is provided to us.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Which Delivery Format Should I Select?</strong><br />
                    Various products are available in different formats on our site. The list of formats in which the product is available is displayed on the right hand side of each product page. You can simply use the mouse pointer to click on the question mark (?) symbol beside each format to view more details of the respective format. You can also view more information regarding format/license types by clicking on the Formats & Delivery tab on each product page. Following are some of the format/license options offered by Zion Market Research:
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Electronic:</strong><br /> This type of product will be emailed to you as an attachment, or can downloaded from a link sent in an email after receipt of your order and payment. Electronic copy products are generally in a PDF format but can also be in other formats such as Excel, Word, PowerPoint, or Access. The format in which the product is available will be mentioned on the product’s product page. There are various licenses available in electronic format.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Single-User License:</strong><br /> This type allows one person, usually the buyer, to access to the ordered product. The ordered product cannot be distributed to anyone else.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">Multi User License:</strong><br /> This type allows the ordered product to be shared among a maximum of 5 people within an organization.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="underline">
                        Corporate License:
                    </strong><br /> This type allows the product to be shared among all employees of an organization regardless of their geographical location.
                </p>
                <p><strong class="underline">Hard Copy:</strong><br /> This product type will be shipped to you in either hard or soft cover format after receipt of your order and payment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 divtopmargin">
            @{ Html.RenderPartial("_contact"); }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<style>
    .underline {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    li{
        margin-left: 15px;
    }
</style>
@section metaTags{
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
}